  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.0: Added STL (EBU Tech 3264) export support via new STLExporter class. Convert T42/VBI teletext data to EBU STL subtitle format with automatic GSI header generation, teletext-to-STL character mapping, and proper TTI block encoding. Includes support for double-height text, box mode detection, and configurable output options.",
